Valve Corporation
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Counter-Strike, CS:GO, CS2 and Valve are trademarks of Valve Corporation.
Music kit names, descriptions, box names, cover art, audio, game data and
release-note text belong to Valve Corporation and the respective artists.

  - data/upstream/ holds excerpts of Valve game data (music definitions,
